2181 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project develops a low-cost Smart Classroom Occupancy and Energy Monitoring prototype using theSTM32 NUCLEO-L476RG and multiple sensors. The system estimates the classroom occupancy condition in real time as EMPTY, LOW, or HIGH.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1995 0 R
/Next 2317 0 R
>>
endobj
2182 0 obj
<<
/Title (It provides a decision-support indication; it does not connect directly to room mains power, lighting circuits or air conditioning equipment.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1995 0 R
/Prev 2318 0 R
>>
endobj
2183 0 obj
<<
/Title (Energy use may continue although room occupancy has changed.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1996 0 R
/Next 2319 0 R
>>
endobj
2184 0 obj
<<
/Title (Embedded deployment constraint: The solution must estimate occupancy locally within the memory and processing limits of the STM32 microcontroller. It must remain a safe low-voltage decision-support prototype without direct connection to building mains equipment.)
